[{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0117","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0117.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-0116","title":"RealPlayer SP 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 11.0 至 11.1 及 RealPlayer SP 1.0 至 1.1.4 版本在 Windows 平台上处理 QCP 文件时存在整数溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过诱导用户打开精心构造的恶意 QCP 文件，触发整数溢出进而引发堆缓冲区溢出，实现远程任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台上受影响版本的 RealPlayer，CVSS 评分 9.3（AV:N/AC:M/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），属高危漏洞，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，成功利用可完全控制目标系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0116"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-08-30T20:00:01.827","updated":"2026-06-16T23:15:30.537","remediation":"建议立即升级 RealPlayer 至 SP 12.0.0.879 或更高版本（访问 real.com 下载最新版）。若无法立即升级，建议卸载 RealPlayer 或在受信任环境中禁用 QCP 文件关联，禁止打开不可信的 .qcp 文件，并在防火墙层面限制 RealPlayer 进程的网络访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/41096","http://secunia.com/advisories/41154","http://secunia.com/secunia_research/2010-3/","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/08262010_player/en/","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024370","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2216","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/61420","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A7326","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2010/0xxx/CVE-2010-0116.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-0116","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2010-0116.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-0116.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-q3x6-x3m5-f2j3/GHSA-q3x6-x3m5-f2j3.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_win.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_112700_112800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3e68d592-8d94-42ef-ab9e-4e43cd80ae53.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-0116.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0117.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0069","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0069.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-1870","title":"Apache Struts2 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Apache Struts2 2.0.0 至 2.1.8.1 版本中的 XWork 组件存在 OGNL 表达式求值漏洞（S2-005），由于 OGNL 广泛的表达式求值能力使用了宽松的白名单机制，远程未授权攻击者可通过构造恶意 OGNL 表达式，利用 #context、#_memberAccess、#root、#this、#_typeResolver、#_classResolver、#_traceEvaluations、#_lastEvaluation、#_keepLastEvaluation 等上下文变量绕过 ParameterInterceptors 中的 \"#\" 字符保护机制，修改服务端上下文对象并执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 Apache Struts2 2.0.0～2.1.8.1 版本及基于此构建的 Atlassian Fisheye、Crucible 等产品，攻击者无需认证即可远程发起攻击，可导致服务器完全被接管。该漏洞不同于 CVE-2008-6504，属于独立的 OGNL 表达式注入漏洞，CVSS 评分 5.0（中等严重度）。官方已在 Struts 2.2.0 版本中修复该漏洞，建议用户升级至 2.2.0 或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1870"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-08-17T20:00:03.407","updated":"2026-06-16T23:19:29.683","remediation":"升级到 Apache Struts 2.2.0 或更高版本，该版本默认收紧了 OGNL 表达式的白名单并修复 `#_memberAccess` 保护机制绕过问题。若无法立即升级，可在自定义 Action 中实现 `ParameterNameAware` 接口，在 `acceptableParameterName` 中拒绝包含 `#`、`(`、`)` 等字符的参数名以阻断 OGNL 上下文变量注入；同时在 Web 应用防火墙(WAF)规则中拦截含 `#context`、`#_memberAccess`、`#root` 等字符串的请求参数作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.o0o.nu/2010/07/cve-2010-1870-struts2xwork-remote.html","http://confluence.atlassian.com/display/FISHEYE/FishEye+Security+Advisory+2010-06-16","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/159643/LISTSERV-Maestro-9.0-8-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2010/Jul/183","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2020/Oct/23","http://secunia.com/advisories/59110","http://securityreason.com/securityalert/8345","http://struts.apache.org/2.2.1/docs/s2-005.html","http://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20140709-struts2","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14360","http://www.osvdb.org/66280","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/41592","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14360","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1870.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-1870.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-1870.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24b6c514a7b18b3a83429b0eaa19c9cb61a02fb8/cves/2010/1xxx/CVE-2010-1870.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/info/cve-2010-1870-1817.yaml","https://github.com/govbk/WIKI-POC-EXP/blob/7d1194429dab9f9dd8139408e79b70ddb41a468f/%E9%9B%B6%E7%BB%84%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3/160-Apache%20Struts/005-%EF%BC%88CVE-2010-1870%EF%BC%89s2-005.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/cve-2010-1870-1819.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2010-1870-2.yaml","https://github.com/zhzyker/vulmap/blob/3694afb7a3adec0b7f7c9027aab596e7b147c585/readme.md","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2010-1870.yaml","https://github.com/KeepHowling/all_freaking_nuclei_templates/blob/b374318732b6922f72d327c57451a7d30973c0c6/CVE-2010-1870-2.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0069.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0106","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2861","title":"Adobe ColdFusion 管理控制台目录遍历漏洞","description":"Adobe ColdFusion 9.0.1 及更早版本的管理控制台存在多处目录遍历漏洞，攻击者可通过向 CFIDE/administrator 下的 settings/mappings.cfm、logging/settings.cfm、datasources/index.cfm、j2eepackaging/editarchive.cfm 以及 enter.cfm 等页面的 locale 参数注入路径遍历序列，绕过访问控制读取服务器上的任意文件，从而获取敏感配置信息或凭据。该漏洞无需认证即可远程利用，已被 CISA 纳入已知被利用漏洞目录。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2861"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2010-08-11","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 Adobe ColdFusion 至 9.0.2 或更高版本，或按照 Adobe 安全公告 APSB10-18 的指引安装官方补丁。如暂时无法升级，应在 Web 服务器或应用层对 locale 参数进行严格白名单校验，禁止包含 ../ 等路径遍历字符的请求到达管理控制台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T15:41:24.231132230+00:00","references":["https://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb10-18.html","http://www.gnucitizen.org/blog/coldfusion-directory-traversal-faq-cve-2010-2861/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-2861"],"poc_urls":["http://www.gnucitizen.org/blog/coldfusion-directory-traversal-faq-cve-2010-2861/"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0306","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0306.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-1871","title":"Red Hat JBoss Enterprise Application Platform JBoss Seam 2 表达式语言注入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"JBoss Seam 2 组件存在表达式语言（EL）注入漏洞，由于其对 JBoss EL 表达式的输入过滤不严，远程攻击者可通过向 JBoss Enterprise Application Platform 4.3.0 发送特制 URL 触发该漏洞，实现任意文件上传或远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 平台上的 JBoss EAP 4.3.0，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。仅在 Java Security Manager 未正确配置时受影响，厂商已发布修复建议。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1871"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2010-08-05T13:23:09.477","updated":"2026-06-16T23:19:29.840","remediation":"升级 JBoss Enterprise Application Platform 至 4.3.0 CP07 及以上版本，或升级 JBoss Seam 至 2.2.1.CR2 及以上版本，以修复 Seam 组件对 EL 表达式输入过滤不严的问题。同时确保正确配置 Java Security Manager，限制表达式引擎权限，并部署 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 拦截包含 EL 表达式的恶意请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2013-05/0117.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0564.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/41994","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024253","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/1929","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=615956","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/60794","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20161017-0001/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-1871","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36653","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2010/CVE-2010-1871.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2010-1871.yml","https://github.com/zema1/yarx/blob/415b606b7a170d061c668936f34c183cea8788bf/pocs/jboss-cve-2010-1871.yml","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog-pocs/blob/253291be2d307a6c836d5997bbb838f1e846f9ba/CVE/2010/CVE-2010-1871.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2010/CVE-2010-1871.rules","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2010-1871.json","https://github.com/orangetw/My-CTF-Web-Challenges/blob/46e3863275880e2fc025a43303d09a50f2da22c3/README.md","https://github.com/WyAtu/Perun/blob/c081b9ed0243cecfcea251e72e2905103a6556a1/vuln/jboss/jboss_adminconsole.py","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2010/CVE-2010-1871/README_KO.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0306.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0102","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0102.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2920","title":"Joomla! Foobla Suggestions 组件 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"Joomla! 组件 Foobla Suggestions 1.5.1.2 存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22），攻击者可通过 index.php 的 controller 参数传入目录遍历序列（如 ../）读取服务器任意文件。该漏洞影响使用该组件的 Joomla! 站点，CVSS 评分 6.8（中危），攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，通过构造恶意 controller 参数实现任意文件读取，可能导致敏感配置文件、源代码泄露。ExploitDB 已收录公开利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2920"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-07-30T20:30:03.927","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:45.433","remediation":"升级或卸载存在漏洞的 Foobla Suggestions (com_foobla_suggestions) 组件 1.5.1.2 版本，或替换为其修复版本（需过滤 controller 参数中的 \"../\" 等目录穿越字符）。若无法立即更新，可在 Joomla! 后台禁用该组件，并通过 .htaccess 添加规则拒绝 index.php 请求中携带 \"controller=../\" 或 NULL 字节等穿越序列，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1004-exploits/joomlafoobla-lfi.txt","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12120","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/39341","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/1844","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/57660","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12120","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2920.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-2920.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2920.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-2920.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2010-2920-1980.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2010-2920.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-2920_10.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d6a37376bba332b033eeef800cc2b5fc0701d843/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-2920.json","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Nov/13/lfiArtifact/lfiReport.csv","https://github.com/tholian-network/vulnerabilities/blob/cd8798a37e6d58633681c9596bee14e4189ad0e9/database/vulnerability/CVE-2010-2920.json","https://github.com/1in9e/gosint/blob/bdda4461515c4398c08638676bbbfe451b73ff95/client/vuln_scan/nuclei/tools/nuclei-templates/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2920.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0102.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0101","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0101.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2918","title":"Joomla! Visites 组件 远程文件包含漏洞","description":"Joomla! Visites 组件 1.1 RC2 版本的 core/include/myMailer.class.php 文件存在 PHP 远程文件包含漏洞，攻击者可通过 mosConfig_absolute_path 参数传入恶意 URL，引入并执行任意 PHP 代码。该漏洞影响 Joomla! Visites 1.1 RC2 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），属于 CWE-94 代码注入类别。攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，通过构造恶意 URL 参数实现远程代码执行，攻击者可完全控制受影响服务器。ExploitDB 已公开该漏洞的利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2918"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-07-30T20:30:03.847","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:45.213","remediation":"立即卸载或升级存在漏洞的 Joomla! Visites (com_joomla-visites) 组件 1.1 RC2 至官方修复版本（或移除该组件）；若暂无法升级，可在 php.ini 中设置 allow_url_fopen=Off 与 allow_url_include=Off 禁用远程文件包含，并在 Web 服务器层面使用 .htaccess 限制对 components/com_joomla-visites/ 目录的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/0804-exploits/joomlavisites-rfi.txt","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14476","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/28942","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/1925","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/42025","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14476","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2918.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-2918.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2918.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-2918.js","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2010-2918-1976.yaml","https://github.com/gongzeq/VAPT3/blob/3576a7accf5cbadc8e64924d6ff48393db379ea7/secbot/resource/poc/cve/cve-2010-2918-1977.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bc11f954f9294701a2f089a93a32a20256e69591/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2918.json","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Dec/11/lfiArtifact/lfiReport.csv","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Joomla/CVE-2010-2918.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2010-2918_1.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2010-2918.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2010/POC-AVE-2010-0101.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0101.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0100","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2857","title":"Joomla! Music Manager 组件目录遍历漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 Music Manager 组件存在目录遍历（本地文件包含）漏洞（CWE-22）。该组件在处理 album.html 页面时未对 cid 参数进行充分过滤，远程攻击者可通过在 cid 参数中注入 \"../\"（点点点）目录遍历序列，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件（如配置文件、密码哈希等敏感数据），并可能借此造成其他未明确的危害。该漏洞影响使用存在缺陷的 Music Manager 组件的所有 Joomla! 站点，攻击者在无需身份认证的情况下即可通过构造特制请求远程发起攻击，CVSS 评分为 6.8，危害等级为中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2857"],"sources":["nuclei","exploit-db","cve"],"published":"2010-07-24","updated":"2026-07-15","remediation":"建议立即卸载或禁用存在漏洞的 Joomla! Music Manager 第三方组件；若必须继续使用，请在组件 album.html 中对 cid 参数使用 intval() 强制取整并过滤 \"../\" 等路径穿越字符，同时升级到官方已修复该缺陷的版本。临时缓解措施包括在 Joomla 全局配置中将 PHP 的 allow_url_include 设为 Off，并将组件目录文件权限设为只读。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1007-exploits/joomlamusicmanager-lfi.txt","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14274","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/41485","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/60195","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2857.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0308","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0308.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2568","title":"Microsoft Windows LNK 快捷方式文件远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Shell 在处理 .LNK 和 .PIF 快捷方式文件的图标显示时存在远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者可通过构造恶意的快捷方式文件（如放置在 U 盘或网络共享中），当 Windows Explorer 自动解析其图标时触发漏洞，无需用户额外交互即可执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows XP SP3、Server 2003 SP2、Vista SP1/SP2、Server 2008 SP2/R2 及 Windows 7 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高危。2010 年 7 月已被在野利用，Microsoft 已发布安全公告 MS10-046 修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2568"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2010-07-22T05:43:49.703","updated":"2026-06-16T23:20:59.973","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS10-046 (KB2286198) 补丁，该补丁修复了 Windows Shell 处理 .LNK 和 .PIF 快捷方式文件时的图标显示漏洞。临时缓解措施包括：禁用 WebClient 服务、在防火墙阻止 TCP 139/445 端口、禁用自动播放功能，以及通过组策略限制用户安装未签名 ActiveX 控件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://isc.sans.edu/diary.html?storyid=9181","http://isc.sans.edu/diary.html?storyid=9190","http://krebsonsecurity.com/2010/07/experts-warn-of-new-windows-shortcut-flaw/","http://secunia.com/advisories/40647","http://securitytracker.com/id?1024216","http://www.f-secure.com/weblog/archives/00001986.html","http://www.f-secure.com/weblog/archives/new_rootkit_en.pdf","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/940193","http://www.microsoft.com/technet/security/advisory/2286198.mspx","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/41732","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA10-222A.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2010/ms10-046","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A11564","https://www.geoffchappell.com/notes/security/stuxnet/ctrlfldr.htm","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-2568","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16574","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2010/CVE-2010-2568.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2568.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2010/CVE-2010-2568.rules","https://github.com/FuzzySecurity/PowerShell-Suite/blob/720d8fe82396faf74f2ca19a3fe99a5c262a14b9/Export-LNKPwn.ps1","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3e6800281dab3089a8374b9fe419c8b8110ea36/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2568.json","https://github.com/MahdiHedhli/threatpedia/blob/9c95c1bcbb7ff89eda6c0a2154702b1ad72592e4/site/src/content/zero-days/stuxnet-lnk-shortcut-cve-2010-2568.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2010-2568.txt","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/md/%E9%9C%87%E7%BD%91%20Stuxnet%20%E7%9A%84%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90.md","https://github.com/cwbae10-purdue/CTI-EACL24/blob/5990586483b6ba4c7e6eef0ddb1c3698a740308b/threat-reports-large/eset/data/866_a-few-facts-about-win32stuxnet-cve-2010-2568.txt","https://github.com/lprat/static_file_analysis/blob/88f4b3a1811a9db67278b2783276807c8c3e1f44/yara_rules1/lnk.yar"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0308.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0099","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2682","title":"Joomla Realtyna Translator 组件 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 Realtyna Translator（com_realtyna）组件 1.0.15 存在目录遍历（任意文件读取/本地文件包含）漏洞。该组件在处理 index.php 的 controller 参数时未对用户输入进行充分过滤校验，攻击者可构造包含「../」（点-点-斜杠）序列的恶意参数，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件（如配置文件、源码等敏感信息），甚至可能进一步造成本地文件包含等其他影响。该漏洞影响使用 com_realtyna 1.0.15 组件的 Joomla! 站点，远程未经身份认证的攻击者仅需发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可利用，无需任何权限或用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级较高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2682"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-07-12T13:27:28.097","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:18.330","remediation":"立即升级 Realtyna Translator (com_realtyna) 组件至官方修复版本，或卸载/禁用该组件（Extensions → Manage → Disable）；无法立即升级时，在 Web 应用防火墙或 .htaccess 中拦截 index.php?option=com_realtyna 请求中包含「../」的 controller 参数，并限制 PHP 对网站目录及系统文件的读取权限以缓解任意文件读取风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1004-exploits/joomlarealtyna-lfi.txt","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14017","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/39337","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/57647","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14017","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2682.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0099.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0098","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0098.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2680","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":16353,\"outputTokens\":36,\"totalTokens\":16389}}","description":"Joomla! 的 JExtensions JE Section/Property Finder（jesectionfinder）组件存在目录遍历漏洞。该组件在处理 index.php 的 view 参数时未对用户输入进行充分过滤，远程攻击者可在 view 参数中插入 \"../\" 等目录遍历序列，从而包含并执行目标服务器上的任意本地文件。攻击无需身份认证，仅需向受影响站点发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发，可导致敏感信息泄露甚至远程代码执行。受影响范围为安装了该缺陷组件的 Joomla! 站点，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2680"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-07-12T13:27:27.923","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:15.113","remediation":"建议立即在 Joomla! 后台 Extensions→Manage 中卸载或禁用存在漏洞的 jesectionfinder 组件，该第三方商业扩展官方已不再维护且无安全更新；若必须保留使用，应修补 components/com_jesectionfinder/ 下对 view 参数的处理代码，改用 JInput 获取输入并配合 basename() 或白名单机制仅允许加载预设视图文件，严禁解析含 \"../\" 的目录遍历序列；作为临时缓解，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache 的 .htaccess 或 Nginx 的 rewrite 规则）中拦截对 /component/jesectionfinder/ 路径中含 \"../\" 或 null 字节的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1006-exploits/joomlajesectionfinder-lfi.txt","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14064","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/41163","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/59796","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14064","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2680.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-2680.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2680.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-2680.js","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6470123a7d8a7a3e512a294dd5d252afb3fc5a2/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-26xx/CVE-2010-2680.json","https://github.com/0xAwali/Virtual-Host/blob/a2988987751a6ab1f30d71e0d002b7af148c5c79/Templates/CVE/CVE-2010-2680.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2010-2680-1955.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2010/CVE-2010-2680.rules","https://github.com/gongzeq/VAPT3/blob/3576a7accf5cbadc8e64924d6ff48393db379ea7/secbot/resource/poc/cve/cve-2010-2680-1959.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/889686929cb8269a754b7b9536317f741fc92ddc/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2680.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-2680_28.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2010/POC-AVE-2010-0098.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0098.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0097","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0097.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2507","title":"Joomla! Picasa2Gallery 组件本地文件包含漏洞（LFI）","description":"Picasa2Gallery（com_picasa2gallery）组件 1.2.8 及更早版本存在目录遍历（本地文件包含）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 index.php 的 controller 参数传入包含 ../ 的路径序列，绕过目录限制读取服务器上的任意文件（如 /etc/passwd），并可能包含并执行本地文件造成进一步影响。攻击仅需构造特制 HTTP 请求，无需认证，利用条件为开启该组件且 PHP 未有效禁用空字节截断。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2507"],"sources":["nuclei","cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2010-06-28","updated":"2026-07-15","remediation":"升级 Picasa2Gallery 组件到官方修复版本，或在 index.php 入口过滤 controller 参数中的 ../ 及空字节（%00），并配置 Joomla! 全局输入过滤以阻止目录遍历。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T18:42:14.489321313+00:00","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2010-2507","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/13981","http://secunia.com/advisories/40297","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/41031","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/59669","http://packetstormsecurity.org/1006-exploits/joomlapicasa2gallery-lfi.txt"],"poc_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/13981","http://packetstormsecurity.org/1006-exploits/joomlapicasa2gallery-lfi.txt"],"exp_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/13981"],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0097.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0130","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0130.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-1387","title":"Apple iTunes 及 iOS WebKit JavaScriptCore 释放后重用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple iTunes 9.2 之前版本（Windows 平台）及 iOS 4 之前版本（iPhone 和 iPod touch）的 WebKit JavaScriptCore 组件存在释放后重用漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造与页面转换相关的恶意网页内容，触发内存对象在释放后被再次访问，导致任意代码执行或应用程序崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.3（严重），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度中等、无需身份认证，机密性/完整性/可用性均受完全影响。此漏洞与 CVE-2010-1763 和 CVE-2010-1769 属于不同漏洞。Apple 已在 iTunes 9.2 和 iOS 4 中修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1387"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-06-18T16:30:01.390","updated":"2026-06-16T23:18:15.263","remediation":"将 iTunes 升级至 9.2 或更高版本（Windows 平台），将 iOS 升级至 4.0 或更高版本（iPhone/iPod touch）。可在 WebKit 设置中禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施，或通过内容过滤网关拦截包含恶意页面跳转的 HTTP 流量。Apple 已通过 iTunes 9.2 更新和 iOS 4 更新修复该漏洞，建议从 Apple 官网或设备设置中立即安装更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Jun/msg00002.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Nov/msg00003.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010/Jun/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-01/msg00006.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/40196","http://secunia.com/advisories/41856","http://secunia.com/advisories/42314","http://secunia.com/advisories/43068","http://securitytracker.com/id?1024108","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4220","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4225","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4456","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:039","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/41016","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1006-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/1512","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2722","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0212","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0552","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/59506","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A7061","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/225c6c94f2eea464da1eabd6045f49a9659b6646/2010/CVE-2010-1387.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3619c6454232bc86bc1c5ee6d49baecbff394f3b/cves/2010/1xxx/CVE-2010-1387.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-1387","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2010-1387","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-59px-m78w-3rc3/GHSA-59px-m78w-3rc3.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f8615defb985bab445eb5487b411802098cc3657/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-1387.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/I/itunes_9_2.nasl","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/secpod_apple_itunes_mult_unspecified_vuln.nasl","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2010-1763","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e705ac69c52c58377c9c34daf8c7b28fb43173a4/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2010-1769"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0130.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0096","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0096.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2307","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":16403,\"outputTokens\":45,\"totalTokens\":16448}}","description":"Motorola SURFBoard SBV6120E 电缆调制解调器固件 SBV6X2X-1.0.0.5-SCM-02-SHPC 的 Web 服务器存在多个目录遍历漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过在 URL 请求中使用多重前导斜杠（//）、点点序列（../）或编码后的点点序列，绕过路径限制读取设备文件系统上的任意文件。该漏洞源于 Web 服务器对用户输入的路径参数缺乏有效规范化与过滤，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，可导致敏感配置文件、日志文件或系统文件泄露，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），影响固件版本 SBV6X2X-1.0.0.5-SCM-02-SHPC 的 Motorola SURFBoard SBV6120E 设备。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2307"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-06-16T20:30:02.717","updated":"2026-06-16T23:20:30.680","remediation":"建议联系运营商（ISP）推送或升级 Motorola SURFBoard SBV6120E 至修复该目录遍历漏洞的新版固件（高于受影响的 SBV6X2X-1.0.0.5-SCM-02-SHPC 版本）；过渡期间在边界防火墙或路由器上配置 ACL，禁止从 WAN 侧及公网访问设备管理地址（默认 192.168.100.1 的 80 端口），仅放行受信任的内网主机，并关闭设备不必要的远程 Web 管理功能以阻断 `///`、`../` 及编码形式的任意文件读取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/40054","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12865","http://www.osvdb.org/65249","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/40550","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/59113","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12865","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2307.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-2307.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2307.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-2307.js","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2010-2307-1943.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2010-2307-1947.yaml","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2307.json","https://github.com/Kaiz7703/My_Tools/blob/a1512a65d2b2896963bf459cd1edcdab0a9bdcba/nuclei-waf-testing/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2307.yaml","https://github.com/PetiteTaupe/automation-cve-testing/blob/8fbac77a20cb4af865eac2393918d158f1941817/data/raw/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2307.json","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs_dev/nucleibak/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2307.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-2307_17.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0096.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0126","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0126.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-0544","title":"Apple Safari WebKit 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Apple Safari 浏览器中的 WebKit 引擎存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，源于对畸形 URL 的处理不当。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造包含恶意脚本的 URL，诱导用户访问后注入任意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码。该漏洞影响 Mac OS X 10.4 至 10.6 及 Windows 平台上的 Safari 4.1 之前版本和 Safari 5.0 之前版本。攻击者可借此窃取用户 Cookie、会话令牌或执行其他恶意操作。Apple 已在 Safari 5.0 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0544"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-06-11T19:30:12.253","updated":"2026-06-16T23:16:22.427","remediation":"立即升级 Apple Safari 至 5.0 版本（Mac OS X 10.5/10.6 及 Windows 平台）或 4.1 版本（Mac OS X 10.4），以修复 WebKit 引擎中因畸形 URL 导致的跨站脚本漏洞。如暂时无法升级，建议启用 Safari 安全浏览功能，并避免点击来源不明的 URL 链接作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Jun/msg00002.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Nov/msg00003.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010/Jun/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010/Jun/msg00003.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/40105","http://secunia.com/advisories/40196","http://secunia.com/advisories/42314","http://securitytracker.com/id?1024067","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4196","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4220","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4225","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4456","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/40620","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/1373","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/1512","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A6656","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1ba39e3ba737b838bba789f1cc5a339b5a2399ad/2010/CVE-2010-0544.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e2b7e39540f8003a5fc1c3ce83959dcdba6671a4/cves/2010/0xxx/CVE-2010-0544.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-0544","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2010.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-f6vq-5p8m-v2h5/GHSA-f6vq-5p8m-v2h5.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2010-0544","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-0544.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2010-0544.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/I/itunes_9_2.nasl","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_apple_safari_mult_vuln_jun10.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2010/POC-AVE-2010-0126.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0126.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0132","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0132.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-1390","title":"Apple Safari 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于 Apple Safari WebKit 渲染引擎中，影响 Windows 平台及 Mac OS X 10.5-10.6 版本的 Safari 4.0.5 及更早版本，对 Mac OS X 10.4 系统的 Safari 4.1 及更早版本也存在影响。漏洞原理是 WebKit 在处理 HTML 文档时对 UTF-7 字符串的规范化处理存在缺陷，且缺乏对引号结尾的完全验证，这导致攻击者能够通过向目标浏览器发送特制的 HTML 文档嵌入恶意 JavaScript 代码。攻击条件方面，攻击者无需身份验证，只需诱使受害者访问由攻击者控制的恶意网站即可触发漏洞。利用方式包括构造包含特殊 Unicode UTF-7 编码和未闭合引号的 HTML 文档，当受害者使用受影响的 Safari 版本浏览时，浏览器会解析这些文档并执行恶意脚本，从而可能导致会话劫持、隐私信息泄露或其他安全影响。该漏洞评分 4.3，表明其 severity 为 MEDIUM 需要中度操作复杂度才能利用，但影响仅限于用户信息，不涉及系统完整性破坏。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1390"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-06-11T18:00:21.020","updated":"2026-06-16T23:18:15.757","remediation":"升级 Apple Safari 至 5.0 版本（Mac OS X 10.5/10.6 及 Windows 系统）或 4.1 版本（Mac OS X 10.4 系统），可通过 Apple 软件更新或 Mac App Store 获取最新补丁。如暂时无法升级，建议在 Safari 偏好设置中禁用 JavaScript 执行，或改用其他浏览器作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Jun/msg00002.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010/Jun/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010/Jun/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-01/msg00006.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/40105","http://secunia.com/advisories/40196","http://secunia.com/advisories/41856","http://secunia.com/advisories/43068","http://securitytracker.com/id?1024067","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4196","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4220","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4225","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:039","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/40620","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1006-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/1373","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/1512","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2722","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0212","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0552","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A6888","https: